  "description": "Clojure/ClojureScript language server for code intelligence",
  "longDescription": "An LSP integration: `.lsp.json` runs the `clojure-lsp` binary, which is installed separately (`brew install clojure-lsp/brew/clojure-lsp-native`, Nix, or a release download), for `.clj`, `.cljs`, `.cljc` and `.edn` files, giving Claude Code go-to-definition, find-references, hover documentation and document symbols on Clojure and ClojureScript code. Nothing else ships: `plugin.json`, `.lsp.json`, a README and the Apache-2.0 license.",
